-- First batch of literature entries (alkenes and styrenes), imported as PENDING.
-- Run once in the Supabase SQL editor after schema.sql, then approve them from the review page.
-- Each row has an import key, so running the file again adds nothing. (Rows inserted by an
-- earlier version of this file have no key: running it again on such a database adds copies.)

on conflict (import_key) do nothing;
